  "description": "Please click email agent on this ad and we will contact you with references etc. that are required. \n\nPlease note we may not be able to reply to all enquiries.\n\nThis unique 2 bedroom duplex apartment is on the first and second floor of a Georgian period house built in 1745.  Recently renovated, it is in excellent condition and boasts original doors, windows, panelling and fire surround. \n\nLocated in the historic Shandon area with a view of St. Mary’s Shandon Steeple from your window, it's only a few minutes walk to the city centre.\n\nAccommodation comprises Entrance Hall, Sitting Room, Kitchen, Dining Room, Bathroom and 2 Bedrooms.\n\nLimited onstreet parking is available close by.  You can apply to Cork City Council for a parking permit to park in the area. \n\nNo pets are allowed at this property.",
